<!--
  A small line offer whose journeys state in place what is elsewhere referred
  to: one journey's day is an availability condition written inside the
  journey (validityConditions holds the condition itself, not a reference to
  it, netex_vehicleJourney_version.xsd), another states its calls instead of a
  pattern with passing times (Call, netex_call_version.xsd). Around them: an
  authority, two operators and a vehicle type; stop places with quays, one
  quay positioned in UTM zone 32N, one on a level its stop place defines and
  one on a level no document defines; lines with an operator and an authority,
  and with a further operator; stop assignments of a point to a stop place and
  a quay, and to a quay alone; a day type of Mondays with its UIC period; a
  journey meeting of the two journeys.
  The availability condition: Tuesday 9 June to Thursday 11 June 2026.
  Written for netex-rs's tests (MIT OR Apache-2.0); places, lines and times
  are invented.
-->
